         phys_view().initialized,
         phys_view().inv(),
         frame.inv(),
     ensures
         phys_view().inv(),
         phys_view().initialized,
         // A pure query: on success it returns the frame's current refcount (and
         // the frame is allocated); on failure the frame is not allocated.
